1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,750
(Sheldon:)Did you bring a friend?

2
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:03,350
(Amy:)No.

3
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:05,850
(Sheldon:)Then as a mental exercise
I invite you

4
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:10,730
(Sheldon:)to figure out why the two of us
can't play three-person chess.

5
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:15,130
(Sheldon:)Can you believe this guy?

6
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:18,870
(Sheldon:)Social protocol does, however,

7
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:20,540
(Sheldon:)require me to bring you
a hot beverage

8
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,800
(Sheldon:)in your time of need.

9
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,040
(Raj:)No, thank you. I'm fine.

10
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,710
(Sheldon:)It's not optional.

11
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:29,010
(Sheldon:)We're out of tea.
I hope you like bouillon.

12
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:32,980
(Raj:)I, uh, I guess you're probably
wondering what's got me down.

13
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,700
(Sheldon:)Actually, I was wondering

14
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,820
(Sheldon:)if I could add
a third new chess piece.

15
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:40,370
(Sheldon:)How do you think people
would feel about Prince Joey--

16
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:44,030
(Sheldon:)the king's feeble-minded
but well-meaning cousin?

17
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:46,130
(Raj:)I'm going to be 30 years old,

18
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,230
(Raj:)and I have no one in my life
to love me.

19
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:50,900
(Raj:)I'm such a basket case, I can't
even talk to a woman

20
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,930
(Raj:)without having alcohol
in my body.

21
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:55,740
(Sheldon:)The fun thing about
Prince Joey

22
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:59,570
(Sheldon:)is every time he moves,
